{"h":3106,"w":2400,"lines":[{"x":0.80075188135859365,"y":0.081395348855457961,"t":"Test 1","w":0.054511273701985608,"c":1,"h":0.014547986671069491},{"w":0.65977442423502597,"t":"had been collected over the last hundred years, which is a very short time in evolutionary","x":0.077067675000223948,"y":0.12936046531399126,"c":1,"h":0.01455453773198867},{"y":0.14356685807210579,"t":"terms. And she found that during that time, these small mammals had experienced a jump in","h":0.017312374716793699,"x":0.077013257681379621,"w":0.68620254516601564,"c":1},{"h":0.014617245042239602,"c":1,"t":"brain size when compared to rural mammals. Now, we can't be sure this means they're more","y":0.15988372112596638,"w":0.68421051025390622,"x":0.078947376267283903},{"c":1,"x":0.078947363168465901,"y":0.17578879563402861,"t":"intelligent, but since the sizes of other parts of the body didn't change, it does suggest that","w":0.66729324340820306,"h":0.01461818090808531},{"w":0.67105265299479167,"t":"something cognitive was going on. And Snell-Rood thinks that this change might reflect the","h":0.014534883321060788,"y":0.19186046531367273,"x":0.078947357637876747,"c":1},{"t":"cognitive demands of adjusting to city life - having to look in different places to find food, for","h":0.014555473597834268,"y":0.20637475861502175,"c":1,"x":0.078947374441315651,"w":0.67857142130533854},{"c":1,"w":0.4022556304931641,"h":0.014577000354538461,"t":"example, and coping with a whole new set of dangers.","x":0.078947374759683608,"y":0.22238372100904324},{"t":"Then over in Germany at the Max Planck Institute, there's another biologist called Catarina","h":0.016111914296343621,"c":1,"y":0.2456395346099437,"w":0.67105265299479167,"x":0.078947357610835808},{"h":0.014611629233080903,"c":1,"w":0.66917292277018237,"x":0.078947373104092305,"y":0.26162790717455398,"t":"Miranda who's done some experiments with blackbirds living in urban and rural areas. And"},{"t":"she's been looking not at their anatomy but at their behaviour. So as you might expect, she's","y":0.27752736648552179,"w":0.68421051025390633,"h":0.014623796103158782,"c":1,"x":0.07706767711338984},{"x":0.077067657223747824,"w":0.68045115152994795,"h":0.014534883321060899,"t":"found that the urban blackbirds tend to be quite bold - they're prepared to face up to a lot of","c":1,"y":0.29360465136071778},{"h":0.014618180908085199,"c":1,"t":"threats that would frighten away their country counterparts. But there's one type of situation","y":0.30959302345365436,"w":0.67857142130533854,"x":0.077067672708742235},{"w":0.65789474487304689,"c":1,"t":"that does seem to frighten the urban blackbirds, and that's anything new - anything they.","x":0.077067665084282352,"y":0.32412790717390505,"h":0.014571384545379651},{"y":0.33862096431346433,"w":0.6730081685384115,"c":1,"x":0.077024270253719981,"h":0.017483651676411416,"t":"haven't experienced before. And if you think about it, that's quite sensible for a bird living in"},{"c":1,"y":0.35608499678282435,"t":"the city.","x":0.077067669346969722,"h":0.013200257566001294,"w":0.060150375366210942},{"y":0.2456395350382341,"h":0.014534883321060788,"x":0.77819548799442673,"c":1,"w":0.033834587732950894,"t":"Q36"},{"t":"Q37","h":0.015851574103753929,"y":0.30759233929572694,"c":1,"x":0.77704358640668869,"w":0.036160507202148362},{"y":0.40261627926763166,"w":0.68233083089192703,"c":1,"t":"Jonathan Atwell, in Indiana University, is looking at how a range of animals respond to urban","h":0.014640642916549873,"x":0.077067667164140805},{"y":0.41697938980963323,"w":0.67302769978841137,"h":0.016192635795951871,"t":"environments. He's found that when they're under stress, their endocrine systems react by.","x":0.077026261862040049,"c":1},{"t":"reducing the amount of hormones such as corticosterone into their blood. It's a sensible-","x":0.077067670608934505,"y":0.43459302331096206,"w":0.6541353352864584,"h":0.013081395234588844,"c":1},{"t":"seeming adaptation. A rat that gets scared every time a subway train rolls past won't be very","w":0.68045115152994795,"x":0.077067657245208962,"y":0.44912790670225688,"h":0.01610068329211134,"c":1},{"c":1,"y":0.46472424892391362,"h":0.013865455534100457,"w":0.086659393310546881,"t":"successful.","x":0.076971055366221078},{"y":0.48837209322114339,"c":1,"w":0.67105265299479178,"h":0.014534883321060788,"t":"There's just one more study I'd like to mention which is by Sarah Partan and her team, and","x":0.07706765837102518},{"h":0.017531373465514144,"y":0.50272783279525945,"t":"they've been looking at how squirrels communicate in an urban environment, and they've","w":0.6598818969726562,"x":0.077017763243742085,"c":1},{"x":0.077021329311046619,"w":0.6391843668619791,"y":0.51882830683334735,"c":1,"h":0.016041971220174922,"t":"found that a routine part of their communication is carried out by waving their tails. You"},{"c":1,"t":"do also see this in the country, but it's much more prevalent in cities, possibly because it's","w":0.66180552164713546,"x":0.0769886539042587,"h":0.017602443388025746,"y":0.53388450385802166},{"w":0.23898811340332032,"t":"effective in a noisy environment.","x":0.076931231524588861,"y":0.5507344879526781,"h":0.016852451307268423,"c":1},{"h":0.0146125650989265,"t":"So what are the long-term implications of this? One possibility is that we may see completely","c":1,"x":0.077067661536068643,"w":0.68609024047851563,"y":0.57405022539498829},{"y":0.59011627926704013,"x":0.077067676165185339,"h":0.014534883321060788,"t":"new species developing in cities. But on the other hand, it's possible that not all of these","c":1,"w":0.65037592569986979},{"y":0.60324231922642557,"h":0.018620707799907765,"x":0.077000373611817094,"t":"adaptations will be permanent. Once the animal's got accustomed to its new environment, it","c":1,"w":0.67871683756510415},{"w":0.35353037516276048,"h":0.016278542016908037,"c":1,"y":0.62057203100510072,"t":"may no longer need the features it's developed.","x":0.078862054651469629},{"c":1,"t":"So, now we've had a look ...","y":0.6429119527082563,"x":0.078819234178659006,"w":0.20699321746826171,"h":0.015729751267589798},{"h":0.013081395234588955,"x":0.77631578915263388,"t":"Q38","c":1,"y":0.41860465118144008,"w":0.03571428616841632},{"w":0.033834587732950894,"y":0.5043604651349286,"h":0.013081395234588733,"x":0.77631578875183493,"t":"Q39","c":1},{"x":0.76879699181732031,"t":"Q40","y":0.57412790699539373,"c":1,"w":0.041353384653727177,"h":0.013081395234588844},{"c":1,"y":0.9651162790674308,"t":"101","x":0.81766917224767366,"w":0.033834587732950783,"h":0.013081395234588844}]}